// (localize / appLocale come from ../zzz/i18n when the app is multilingual.)
// The permission prompt can be tried before publishing: in the browser preview it is a SIMULATED
// iOS alert drawn inside the preview phone, in Expo Go and the published app the real system one.
// Notifications themselves only ARRIVE in the published app (TestFlight / App Store): elsewhere
// registerForPush answers { ok: false, reason: 'unavailable', permission: 'granted' } — expected,
